{"id":"planta","lemma":"planta","pos":"noun","rank":1454,"glosses":["plant (an organism of the kingdom Plantae, and now specifically, a living organism of the Embryophyta (land plants) or of the Chlorophyta (green algae), a eukaryote that includes double-membraned chloroplasts in its cells containing chlorophyll a and b, or any organism closely related to such an organism)","plant (factory)","floor, level (of a high building)"],"ipa":"/ˈplanta/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"plantas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/39/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-planta.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Pueden las plantas sentir dolor?","en":"Can plants feel pain?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/454520","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"the / them"},null,{"g":"to feel"},{"g":"pain"}]},{"text":"Se está muriendo la planta.","en":"The plant is dying.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523636","words":[{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to die","l":"morir"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"¿Te harías cargo de mis plantas mientras estoy fuera?","en":"Would you care for my plants while I'm away?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/514735","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"charge, burden"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my"},null,{"g":"while, whilst, as"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"outside, out"}]},{"text":"Esa planta necesita sombra.","en":"That plant needs shade.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523638","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ese"},null,{"g":"to need","l":"necesitar"},{"g":"shadow is blocked by…"}]},{"text":"Estamos en la tercera planta.","en":"We're on the third floor.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/567285","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"a third"},null]}]}